#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
#: assets/ui/setup_wizard.ui
msgid "Advanced · recommended"
msgstr "Avanzado · recomendado"

#: android/app/src/main/kotlin/io/pierrotws/passel/SetupWizard.kt
msgid ""
"An empty private repository you created for it (GitHub, GitLab…). Your vault "
"is backed up with its whole history, and opens with pass and Passel on your "
"computers too."
msgstr ""
"Un repositorio privado vacío que creaste para ello (GitHub, GitLab…). Tu "
"bóveda se respalda con todo su historial y también se abre con pass y Passel "
"en tus ordenadores."

